---
description: Recover version-bound assertions without promoting character belief to world fact.
args: { edition:SerialEdition; evidence:EvidenceItem[] }
returns: CanonAssertion[]
---
Use approved edition scene references to locate each assertion. Preserve its kind, subject, origin and confidence. A character's statement remains belief unless another source establishes the fact. Mark unreliable narration as narrative evidence only. Preserve conflicting draft assertion alongside approved canon and surface the conflict.
